SOAPBOX: The team encountered numerous issues with N1MM/WJST-X in the beginning of the contest. After some troubleshooting, it was determined that the latest version of N1MM, just downloaded & installed prior to the contest, was the issue. The contest was moved to a different PC running an older version. We were able to continue operating the contest from there.
SOAPBOX: Otherwise, it was a fun, nice easy contest & all operators enjoyed it. Band conditions were great. We all look forward to the next Digi contest!!
